# VADL environment variables
#
# The Milestone 1 prototype needs no environment variables and no secrets.
# Copy this file to .env.local only when a later milestone documents a variable.
#
# Rules:
# - Never commit a real .env file (it is git-ignored).
# - Vite exposes every VITE_* variable to the browser bundle, so a secret
#   must NEVER be given a VITE_ prefix. Secrets belong to a future backend only.
#
# Example of a non-secret, browser-visible setting (not yet used):
# VITE_APP_STAGE=development
